section -- merged from Development.AbelianVarietyTheory.Proofs.DivisorProofs.HasHermitianSignatureComplementHyperbolicPlaneStatement
open scoped TensorProduct Matrix
open NumberField IsDedekindDomain Formalism.MainNotions.GlobalTheoryTheory.GenusMassVolumes
